    "ArtiKataDV": "IS THERE? / HAS THERE? / WOULD YOU?",
    "TeksArtiDV": "ފަހެ، އެއުރެން ބުނާނެތެވެ. (إيمان ވުމަށްޓަކައި) ތިމަންމެންނަށް ލަސްކޮށްލައްވާނެ ހެއްޔެވެ؟",
    "BentukKataNO": "6. Spørrepartikler (Harf Istifham)",
    "SuratArtiNO": "Ash-Shu'ara (Skaldene)",
    "ArtiKataNO": "IS THERE? / HAS THERE? / WOULD YOU?",
    "TeksArtiNO": "Og de vil si: «Kan vi få utsettelse?»",
    "BentukKataPL": "6. Partykuły pytające (Harf Istifham)",
    "SuratArtiPL": "Asz-Szu'ara (Poeci)",
    "ArtiKataPL": "IS THERE? / HAS THERE? / WOULD YOU?",
    "TeksArtiPL": "Oni wtedy powiedzą: \"Czy my znajdziemy się wśród tych, którym będzie dana zwłoka?\"",
